{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07515","headline":"山鸜鹆歌 · 刘长卿","name":"山鸜鹆歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山鸜鹆，长在此山吟古木。\n嘲唽相呼响空谷，哀鸣万变如成曲。\n江南逐臣悲放逐，倚树听之心断续。\n巴人峡里自闻猨，燕客水头空击筑。\n山鸜鹆，一生不及双黄鹄。\n朝去秋田啄残粟，暮入寒林啸羣族。\n鸣相逐，啄残粟，食不足。\n青云杳杳无力飞，白露苍苍抱枝宿。\n不知何事守空山，万壑千峰自愁独。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}